WEBVTT

00:00:29.545 --> 00:00:34.041
The challenge for 2030
is to convert our supply chain,

00:00:34.065 --> 00:00:35.946
and that work has already begun.

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:38.091
We already have 70 suppliers,

00:00:38.115 --> 00:00:41.996
over eight gigawatts
of energy coming online

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:43.826
in our supply chain,

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:45.576
and then our last piece

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:48.456
will be to convert the energy
that our customers use

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:50.766
to charge our devices

00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:51.964
to clean energy.

00:00:51.988 --> 00:00:53.916
LO: What are some of the biggest changes

00:00:53.940 --> 00:00:56.813
that Apple's going to need to make
in its business operations

00:00:56.837 --> 00:00:58.853
in order to be able
to achieve those goals?

00:00:58.877 --> 00:01:03.026
